 "summary": "The line-oriented hypertext format (text/gemini) of the Gemini protocol: each line is classified by its first characters as text, link (=>), heading (#), list item (*), quote (>) or preformatting toggle (```), with no inline markup, so parsing needs only a one-bit state.",
 "status": "active",
